## Model card

- **Name:** Hy3 Preview (hunyuan hy3 preview)
- **Short description:** Tencent's April 2026 MoE preview (295B total, 21B active, 256K context), superseded July 2026 by full Hy3.
- **Provider / access:** Tencent Hunyuan via https://api.hunyuan.cloud.tencent.com/v1 (model `hy3-preview`), TokenHub; Chat Completions
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-04 preview; superseded 2026-07 by Hy3 full release
- **IDs:** `tencent/hy3-preview` (no Zen Free ID)
- **Context window:** 256,000 total (256K in / 32K out) — verified via meta.json and TokenHub
- **Modalities:** text, image in; text out; reasoning yes; tool calls yes
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-25):** TokenHub preview ~$0.18 in / $0.59 out per 1M (no Zen Free ID)
- **Architecture:** MoE 295B total / 21B active, KDA hybrid linear attention

